'''Kappy Jr.''' (かわわっぱJr., '''''Kawawappa Jr.''''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|Flow Like the Stream]]. He was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kappy Jr.
|image = E 495.png
|first appearance = [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|Bottom of the Swamp]]<br>'''ZL:''' [[Meeting of Long and Short|Sub-chapter 21 - Meeting of Long and Short]]
|money drop = 1,800¢ - 7,110¢
}}

==Enemy==
Though he may be small, Kappy Jr. has high health, does extreme damage and has 100% chance to create a [[Surge Attack]] reaching up to 750 range away from him. In his [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|first]] [[Guided by Currents (Merciless)|two]] appearances, his short range and slightly delayed attack make it easy for him to miss when the [[Scissoroo]]s are still on the field, but once they're dead, beating him becomes heavily dependent on luck or [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune units]].

